# "Draw two cards" from a library of one card: the first card is drawn and the second draw from an empty library makes Bot1 lose when state-based actions are next checked (CR 704.5b, 121.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Corrupted Conviction
Island x4
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Corrupted Conviction.Cast
Bot1.Choose(additional cost of Corrupted Conviction)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Result = Bot2 won
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
